      "name": "seal_pool",
      "docs": [
        "Permanently seal a pool's DRT composition. After sealing, `register_drt`",
        "is rejected — the set of DRTs under the pool becomes immutable. Grant",
        "and revoke flows are unaffected. Attempting to seal an already-sealed",
        "pool returns `PoolSealed`."
      ],
